@host = http://localhost:5116

### 1. Create → 201
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto123", "ano": 2020, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "ABC-1234" }

### 2. Duplicate plate → 400 {"mensagem":"Dados inválidos"}
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto456", "ano": 2021, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "ABC-1234" }

### 3. Duplicate id → 400
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto123", "ano": 2021, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "DEF-5678" }

### 4. List all → 200 [ ... ]
GET {{host}}/motos

### 5. Filter by plate → 200 with 1 item
GET {{host}}/motos?placa=ABC-1234

### 6. Not found → 404 {"mensagem":"Moto não encontrada"}
GET {{host}}/motos/does-not-exist

### 7. Change plate → 200 {"mensagem":"Placa modificada com sucesso"}
PUT {{host}}/motos/moto123/placa
Content-Type: application/json

{ "placa": "XYZ-9999" }

### 8. Empty body → 400 {"mensagem":"Dados inválidos"}
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 9. Delete → 200 (then re-run #6 with moto123 → 404)
DELETE {{host}}/motos/moto123


### 10. Moto from 2020 → 201, event published, NO notification stored
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto-2020", "ano": 2020, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "AAA-2020" }

### 11. Moto from 2024 → 201, event published, notification STORED
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto-2024.2", "ano": 2024, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "BBB-2222" }


### 12. Create courier type A with a PNG image → 201
POST {{host}}/entregadores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "entregador1",
  "nome": "João da Silva",
  "cnpj": "12345678901234",
  "data_nascimento": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "numero_cnh": "12345678900",
  "tipo_cnh": "A",
  "imagem_cnh": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNkYAAAAAYAAjCB0C8AAAAASUVORK5CYII="
}

### 13. Create courier type A+B WITHOUT image → 201
POST {{host}}/entregadores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "entregador2",
  "nome": "Maria Souza",
  "cnpj": "98765432109876",
  "data_nascimento": "1995-05-10T00:00:00Z",
  "numero_cnh": "98765432100",
  "tipo_cnh": "A+B"
}

### 14. Duplicate CNPJ → 400
POST {{host}}/entregadores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "entregador3",
  "nome": "Outro",
  "cnpj": "12345678901234",
  "data_nascimento": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "numero_cnh": "11111111111",
  "tipo_cnh": "B"
}

### 15. Duplicate CNH number → 400
POST {{host}}/entregadores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "entregador4",
  "nome": "Outro",
  "cnpj": "11111111111111",
  "data_nascimento": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "numero_cnh": "12345678900",
  "tipo_cnh": "B"
}

### 16. Invalid license type "C" → 400 (rejected by the converter)
POST {{host}}/entregadores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador": "entregador5",
  "nome": "Outro",
  "cnpj": "22222222222222",
  "data_nascimento": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "numero_cnh": "22222222222",
  "tipo_cnh": "C"
}

### 17. Upload a BMP for entregador2 → 201
POST {{host}}/entregadores/entregador2/cnh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imagem_cnh": "Qk06AAAAAAAAADYAAAAoAAAAAQAAAAEAAAABABgAAAAAAAQAAAATCwAAEwsAAAAAAAAAAAAA////AA==" }

### 18. Replace entregador1's image with a BMP → 201 (the old PNG file is deleted)
POST {{host}}/entregadores/entregador1/cnh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imagem_cnh": "Qk06AAAAAAAAADYAAAAoAAAAAQAAAAEAAAABABgAAAAAAAQAAAATCwAAEwsAAAAAAAAAAAAA////AA==" }

### 19. Upload a JPEG → 400 (wrong format)
POST {{host}}/entregadores/entregador1/cnh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imagem_cnh": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQABAAA=" }

### 20. Upload invalid base64 → 400
POST {{host}}/entregadores/entregador1/cnh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imagem_cnh": "this is not base64!!" }

### 21. Upload for a courier that doesn't exist → 400
POST {{host}}/entregadores/does-not-exist/cnh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "imagem_cnh": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNkYAAAAAYAAjCB0C8AAAAASUVORK5CYII=" }